event: content_block_start
data: {"type":"content_block_start","index":2,"content_block":{"type":"web_search_tool_result","tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_ds_00_2645d27a322547fe9a5d952c7dccda47","content":[{"type":"web_search_result","title":"DeepSeek发布全家桶应用API","url":"https://www.163.com/dy/article/LBLAGNHH05198CJN.html?spss=dy_author","encrypted_content":"","page_age":"2026-11-12T16:00:00+00:00","snippet":"【DeepSeek发布全家桶应用API】财联社11月13日电，DeepSeek发表公告称，正式开放这套全家桶应用API：在原有API中开启对应参数，即可获得深度思考搜索、文件输入等对话功能；语音及相关底层能力也已开放独立接口（含OCR、ASR、TTS等），支持单独或组合调用。开发者可以在自己的应用中轻松实现复杂的对话功能...","site_name":"网易","site_icon":"https://cdn.deepseek.com/site-icons/163.com"},{"type":"web_search_result","title":"DeepSeek发布全家桶应用API","url":"https://www.sohu.com/a/1101254724_115362?scm=10001.7746_13-119000.0.0-0-0-0-0.0&spm=smpc.channel_354.block3_32_P7Ovbu_1_fd.37.17945803153725fJgfq4_7746","encrypted_content":"","page_age":"2026-11-12T16:00:00+00:00","snippet":"2026-11-13 22:30 发布于：四川省 每经AI快讯，11月13日，DeepSeek公告，正式开放这套全家桶应用API：在原有API中开启对应参数，即可获得深度思考搜索、文件输入等对话功能；语音及相关底层能力也已开放独立接口（含OCR、ASR、TTS等），支持单独或组合调用。开发者可以在自己的应用中轻松实现复杂的对话功能...","site_name":"Sohu","site_icon":"https://cdn.deepseek.com/site-icons/sohu.com"},{"type":"web_search_result","title":"DeepSeek开放“全家桶”应用API，开发者可1:1复刻完整App","url":"https://ishare.ifeng.com/c/s/v0069M--PerMb1L3oHwMy--Jd-_W6l2CgdrNd8SzZDrDHoG88FF1CR7nsupN4ttdEVzZQ21","encrypted_content":"","page_age":"2026-11-12T16:00:00+00:00","snippet":"凤凰网科技讯（编辑/云飞） 11月13日，DeepSeek宣布正式开放“全家桶”应用API，将DeepSeek App中的联网搜索、文件输入、阅读链接、语音交互及安全校验等能力整合进原有API，开发者开启对应参数即可在自有应用中实现复杂对话功能，甚至1:1复刻完整DeepSeek App。","site_name":"凤凰网","site_icon":"https://cdn.deepseek.com/site-icons/ifeng.com"},{"type":"web_search_result","title":"DeepSeek发布全家桶应用API","url":"https://m.stnn.cc/detail/6af71fd88f9d2b19dd7397e2.html","encrypted_content":"","page_age":"2026-11-12T16:00:00+00:00","snippet":"星岛财讯，11月13日，DeepSeek公告，正式开放这套全家桶应用API：在原有API中开启对应参数，即可获得深度思考搜索、文件输入等对话功能；语音及相关底层能力也已开放独立接口（含OCR、ASR、TTS等），支持单独或组合调用。开发者可以在自己的应用中轻松实现复杂的对话功能，甚至1...","site_name":"星岛环球网","site_icon":"https://cdn.deepseek.com/site-icons/stnn.cc"},{"type":"web_search_result","title":"DeepSeek 发布全家桶应用 API：开发者将能 1:1 复刻完整 DeepSeek App","url":"https://www.ithome.com/1/026/960.htm","encrypted_content":"","page_age":"2026-11-12T16:00:00+00:00","snippet":"IT之家 11 月 13 日消息，今天（13 日）晚间，DeepSeek 宣布正式开放全家桶应用 API：在原有 API 中开启对应参数，即可获得深度思考搜索、文件输入等对话功能；语音及相关底层能力也已开放独立接口（含 OCR...","site_name":"IT之家","site_icon":"https://cdn.deepseek.com/site-icons/ithome.com"},{"type":"web_search_result","title":"DeepSeek发布全家桶应用API","url":"https://m.jiemian.com/article/15332487.html","encrypted_content":"","page_age":"2026-11-12T16:00:00+00:00","snippet":"DeepSeek发布全家桶应用API 11月13日，DeepSeek正式开放全家桶应用API。在原有API中开启对应参数，即可获得深度思考搜索、文件输入等对话功能；语音及相关底层能力也已开放独立接口（含OCR、ASR、TTS等），支持单独或组合调用。开发者可以在自己的应用中轻松实现复杂的对话功能...","site_name":"Jiemian.com","site_icon":"https://cdn.deepseek.com/site-icons/jiemian.com"},{"type":"web_search_result","title":"DeepSeek Opens Its App's Search, File, OCR and Voice Tools as APIs So Developers Can Rebuild the App","url":"https://pandaily.com/deepseek-full-suite-application-apis-web-search-file-input-ocr-asr-tts-chat-demo","encrypted_content":"","page_age":"2026-11-12T16:00:00+00:00","snippet":"DeepSeek Opens Its App's Search, File, OCR and Voice Tools as APIs So Developers Can Rebuild the App Published:November 13, 2026 ... The company announced the update in its API change log on November 13.","site_name":"Pandaily","site_icon":"https://cdn.deepseek.com/site-icons/pandaily.com"},{"type":"web_search_result","title":"DeepSeek开放全家桶API，核心功能“开箱即用”","url":"https://tidenews.com.cn/news.html?id=3614347&from_channel=5d8b4d25cf8dfd0001a4143c&top_id=3614350","encrypted_content":"","page_age":"2026-11-12T16:00:00+00:00","snippet":"11月13日，DeepSeek宣布正式开放“全家桶应用API”，将DeepSeek App（含网页端）中联网搜索、文件输入、阅读链接、语音交互及安全审核等核心功能，通过原有API参数开启或独立接口的方式向开发者全面开放。","site_name":"潮新闻","site_icon":"https://cdn.deepseek.com/site-icons/tidenews.com.cn"},{"type":"web_search_result","title":"DeepSeek发布全家桶应用API","url":"https://www.jiemian.com/article/15332487.html","encrypted_content":"","page_age":"2026-11-12T16:00:00+00:00","snippet":"11月13日，DeepSeek正式开放全家桶应用API。在原有API中开启对应参数，即可获得深度思考搜索、文件输入等对话功能；语音及相关底层能力也已开放独立接口（含OCR、ASR、TTS等），支持单独或组合调用。开发者可以在自己的应用中轻松实现复杂的对话功能...","site_name":"Jiemian.com","site_icon":"https://cdn.deepseek.com/site-icons/jiemian.com"},{"type":"web_search_result","title":"DeepSeek 发布全家桶应用 API- DoNews","url":"https://www.donews.com/news/detail/1/6772103.html","encrypted_content":"","page_age":"2026-11-13T16:00:00+00:00","snippet":"杨亮 2026-11-14 00 ... 11月14日消息，13 日晚间，DeepSeek 宣布正式开放全家桶应用 API：在原有 API 中开启对应参数，即可获得深度思考搜索、文件输入等对话功能；语音及相关底层能力也已开放独立接口（含 OCR...","site_name":"DoNews","site_icon":"https://cdn.deepseek.com/site-icons/donews.com"},{"type":"web_search_result","title":"突发！DeepSeek 重磅更新，全家桶 API 来了","url":"https://www.eet-china.com/mp/a539178.html","encrypted_content":"","page_age":"2026-11-12T16:00:00+00:00","snippet":"DeepSeek 重磅更新，全家桶 API 来了 原创 程序员cxuan 2026-11-13 23:30 27浏览 0评论 0点赞 ... 刚刚，DeepSeek 官方的消息，DeepSeek 今天正式开放全家桶 API ... 发布全家桶应用 API","site_name":"电子工程专辑","site_icon":"https://cdn.deepseek.com/site-icons/eet-china.com"}],"kind":"deep_search"}}

